Let $V$ be a $K$-scheme and suppose that $(K,\mathbb{D})\subseteq(L,\mathbb{D}')$ is an extension of $m$-truncated $e$-dimensional HS-fields. Then for any $a\in V(L)$, we have
 $\mathbb{D}'_V(a)\in\nabla V(L)$.

